190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (The Restaurant Order Processing and Billing System is a software application designed to automate the day-to-day operations of a restaurant. The main objective of this system is to simplify order management, improve billing accuracy, and enhance overall customer service. Traditionally, restaurants rely on manual methods for taking orders and generating bills, which can lead to errors, delays, and inefficiencies. This system addresses those issues by providing a computerized solution where orders can be placed, updated, and processed in real time. It allows staff to select menu items, calculate totals automatically, and generate bills instantly. The system typically includes features such as menu management, order tracking, bill generation, and basic reporting. It reduces human effort, minimizes calculation mistakes, and speeds up service delivery. Additionally, it helps in maintaining records of sales and transactions, which can be useful for business analysis. Overall, the Restaurant Order Processing and Billing System improves operational efficiency, ensures accuracy, and provides a better experience for both staff and customers.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
