/Title (The mainobjectives of the Restaurant Order Processing and Billing System are: To automate the process of taking and managing cus tomer orders. To generate accurate bills quickly and reduce manual calculation errors. To improve the speed and efficiency of restaurant operations. To maintain proper records of orders and transactions. To enhance customer satisfaction by providing faster service. To reduce paperwork and human effort in daily activities.)
