/Title (1.2 Overview  The Restaurant Order Processing and Billing System is a software application designed to handle restaurant activities such as order taking, processing, and billing in an efficient manner. In this system, restaurant staff can select items from a digital menu, place orders, and automatically calculate the total bill. The system keeps track of all orders and generates bills instantly. It also stores transaction details for future reference.)
